WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.665
Your earlier learning can help with the next decision

00:00:02.718 --> 00:00:07.718
Recall the difference between receipt decision and completion Why

00:00:07.797 --> 00:00:11.521
does it matter during a handover Now compare with

00:00:11.547 --> 00:00:14.652
the earlier idea Receipt means a message reached someone

00:00:14.915 --> 00:00:18.942
a decision requires the authorised choice completion needs evidence

00:00:18.981 --> 00:00:22.138
the work was done A read receipt is not

00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:26.876
incoming acceptance of the assignment This revisits an earlier

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:31.850
idea after intervening activities It is practice not a

00:00:31.915 --> 00:00:37.323
controlled memory examination A later revisit is recorded separately
